summary:
  A wake-up whose station died is held to the ordinary listener's rule, so
  the namesake that would have rung is refused and the morning stays quiet.

history:
  The fallback tone covers the first 25 seconds only. A station that dies
  after it started is the heal road's to bring back, and there a namesake
  from another country beats silence: the alarm's ladder has to stay what
  it was before the country question existed, the same rows in the same
  order. The library keeps that promise under test; this is the wire that
  carries the alarm's standing order to it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
                                                 run.cc, root._alarmStandingOrder === true);

replace:
                                                 run.cc, false);

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_namesake_is_refused_except_for_a_wake_up_and_named_when_it_plays.
  Line-neutral.
